    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4813" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bācĭfer</span></b> ,
			fĕra, fĕrum, adj.
		baca-fero. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Bearing berries</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taxus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 10, 20, § 50</span></i>
			 (al. leg. bacas fert): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hedera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Oedip. 414</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Acc.
			to baca, I. B., <i>bearing olives</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pallas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 2, 16, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sabinus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					3, 596</span></i>
			.</div>
